Models (not included)
---------------------
No model weights are included or downloaded by the nodes. tools/download_model.py fetches, when you run it:
- Wan-AI/Wan2.1-T2V-1.3B (model card: Apache-2.0): model configuration, umT5-XXL text encoder, VAE, tokenizer.
- JohnZhan/DuoMatching (the repository's LICENSE file: Apache License 2.0): model.pt.